  "aboutGameSubject1": "🎮 3almaShe Run 🎮\n\nStep into the world of 3almaShe Run, where every adventure begins with a single step!\nEach level takes you to a different environment filled with obstacles, surprises, and challenges. Jump, dodge, and collect points to unlock new stages, each with its own unique level of difficulty.\n\nIn this game, speed alone isn't enough — you'll need focus and quick reactions to overcome moving obstacles and tricky traps.\nEvery environment offers a new experience: from busy city streets to tall mountains, dense forests, endless deserts, and more to discover.\n\n⚡ Game Features:\n• Varied stages with changing environments that make every level feel fresh and exciting.\n• Strong bosses at the end of each world that require strategy and skill to defeat.\n• Coin collection system to unlock new characters.\n• Unique characters, each with their own running style and special abilities.\n• In-game store that lets you switch between characters and customize your play style.\n• Simple and smooth controls suitable for players of all ages.\n\n3almaShe Run combines speed, skill, and challenge in an engaging 2D experience where every run brings something new.\nCan you overcome all the obstacles and reach the finish line? Find out and start your adventure!",
